# The simulator's ceiling: a ground station and 1 023 drones on a custody mesh, reporting three times, 5 s apart, as
# hub-telemetry does at forty. Every call to nav draws 1 023 answers; the first lands, the rest find no pending call.
# Signed, gcs is the hub and its 256-line roster believes drones 1 to 255: the other 768 are strangers, Open(Roster)
# on telemetry and indistinguishable late answers on a call. Unsigned, gcs is a leaf with 16 windows, and the drones
# with none share one sender's 64 a second, so 80 of 1 023 reports in one second land, the 65th windowless is Flood and
# 942 are Rate.
seed 1024
peers 1024
profile dtn
5000   telemetry
10000  telemetry
15000  telemetry
